  "details": "There is someone that submitted an idea exactly like this before me and there post will be at the bottom. Full credit to them, I thought of the idea before knowing about there's but I'm still posting mine anyways.  \n\nThere should be a way to chat with friends that are not in the same instance without using the invite/invite request or a third party to text them. You are also able to chat with friends that are in the same instance, and with other people that are not your friends but you would need to send a text chat request first before chatting with a none friend, and they would need to except the text chat request.\n\ntheir post\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/being-able-to-text-my-friends-in-game",
